{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372410/extras/Audioglide.png?t=1745424365\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take your favorite songs and turn them into an electrifying, music-driven adventure! This innovative rhythm game transforms any track you import into a visually stunning, procedurally generated road where every beat shapes the challenge. Soar through vibrant landscapes, collect notes in sync with the music, and experience a fusion of sound, speed, and style like never before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372410/extras/ag_gif.gif?t=1745424365\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Play Any Song\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Import your own music files, and let the game craft a unique level just for you!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic Music Analysis</strong> \u2013 The game detects beats, notes, and BPM to ensure precise rhythm-based gameplay.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Procedural Track Generation</strong> \u2013 Every song creates a one-of-a-kind road, adapting to its energy and volume dynamics.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rhythm-Powered Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Glide along the track, hit notes in sync with the beat, and dodge obstacles to stay in the groove.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Disco Lights &amp; Mesmerizing Effects</strong> \u2013 Experience pulsating neon visuals that react to the music, bringing every song to life.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Compete on  Leaderboards</strong> \u2013 Climb the online leaderboards for any song and prove your rhythm mastery.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Level Editor &amp; Steam Workshop Support</strong> \u2013 Customize, share, and play community-created tracks with infinite replayability!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3372410?t=1745424365","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3372410?t=1745424365","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372410/d2d540a4946a2aad6a17d793df32b24ef4702631/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745424365","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372410/d2d540a4946a2aad6a17d793df32b24ef4702631/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745424365","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372410/extras/Audioglide.png?t=1745424365\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take your favorite songs and turn them into an electrifying, music-driven adventure! This innovative rhythm game transforms any track you import into a visually stunning, procedurally generated road where every beat shapes the challenge. Soar through vibrant landscapes, collect notes in sync with the music, and experience a fusion of sound, speed, and style like never before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372410/extras/ag_gif.gif?t=1745424365\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Play Any Song\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Import your own music files, and let the game craft a unique level just for you!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic Music Analysis</strong> \u2013 The game detects beats, notes, and BPM to ensure precise rhythm-based gameplay.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Procedural Track Generation</strong> \u2013 Every song creates a one-of-a-kind road, adapting to its energy and volume dynamics.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rhythm-Powered Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Glide along the track, hit notes in sync with the beat, and dodge obstacles to stay in the groove.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Disco Lights &amp; Mesmerizing Effects</strong> \u2013 Experience pulsating neon visuals that react to the music, bringing every song to life.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Compete on  Leaderboards</strong> \u2013 Climb the online leaderboards for any song and prove your rhythm mastery.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Level Editor &amp; Steam Workshop Support</strong> \u2013 Customize, share, and play community-created tracks with infinite replayability!</p></li></ul>","developers":["Ospekki"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372410/af04cd2a85d3b847d0cdd16a80aa4aafa87437c0/header.jpg?t=1745424365","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Audioglide","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-9400F / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1050 Ti / RX 570<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</